## Third-party build code

The file `tsdown.config.ts` is a minimal adaptation of the DeepSeek Harness
web build preset `packages/client/tsdown.client.ts` (plus the platform-module
table from `packages/client/web-platform.ts`), originally authored by
DeepSeek (Hangzhou) Innovation Technology Co., Ltd. and distributed under the
MIT License from the `deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness` repository. The same
preset was mirrored by the dsh-web-ui repository (`shared/tsdown.client.ts`,
Apache-2.0) from which this standalone adaptation is derived.

The adaptation keeps only the functionality dsh-devtools requires (node ESM
library, browser CJS client bundle, module-table externals, CSS Modules
inlining with reproducible hashes, sourcemaps, bundle purity gate); mobile
bundles, generic build faces, and workspace-only behavior are removed.

