## npm package contents

The published npm package (dsh-devtools@0.1.0) contains no third-party
source files: all shipped files are original dsh-devtools code or generated
build artifacts (lib/). The runtime bundles reference DeepSeek Harness
peer APIs (`@deepseek-ai/*`) as externals resolved by the Harness runtime,
and inline CSS from the plugin's own stylesheet.
